      <guid>http://localhost:1313/en/posts/my-first-post/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;childhood-and-the-weight-of-worth&#34;&gt;Childhood and the Weight of Worth&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Growing up, I was an underconfident kid, always anxious about my worth as a person. I was good at studies, often coming first in class. Mostly because when I came first, people clapped, showered compliments—external validation became my measure of worth.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
